=== Contracts and legal work, English (contracts/en/) ===

Three agreements from the Contract Understanding Atticus Dataset (CUAD) v1,
by The Atticus Project, under CC BY 4.0, as stated on its Zenodo record
(https://zenodo.org/records/4595826 , doi:10.5281/zenodo.4595826). Citation:
Dan Hendrycks, Collin Burns, Anya Chen and Spencer Ball, "CUAD: An
Expert-Annotated NLP Dataset for Legal Contract Review", NeurIPS 2021
Datasets and Benchmarks. The agreements are public exhibits filed with the
US Securities and Exchange Commission (EDGAR). The files are the dataset's
PDFs, unchanged in content, renamed.

- "Web Site Hosting Agreement (i-on interactive and Centrack).pdf": CUAD file
  full_contract_pdf/Part_II/Hosting/CENTRACKINTERNATIONALINC_10_29_1999-EX-10.3-WEB SITE HOSTING AGREEMENT.PDF .
- "Distributor Agreement (Snotarator and SMSA Ballinger).pdf": CUAD file
  full_contract_pdf/Part_III/Distributor/BLACKBOXSTOCKSINC_08_05_2014-EX-10.1-DISTRIBUTOR AGREEMENT.PDF .
- "Exclusive Distributor Agreement (Erchonia and InnerScope).pdf": CUAD file
  full_contract_pdf/Part_I/Distributor/InnerscopeHearingTechnologiesInc_20181109_8-K_EX-10.6_11419704_EX-10.6_Distributor Agreement.pdf .


